 m_aMissionDescriptors {
  COA_MissionDescriptor "{644250503DF684C0}" {
   m_sTitle "Mission: Search and Destroy"
   m_sTextData "Lore: there's a foreign funded rebel group after receiving some shipments of explosives off the hevossalmi coastline. there in the process of moving them when occupying British forces come barrelling down. "\
   "   "\
   "Mission Type: Search and Destroy"\
   ""\
   "INDFOR: Rebels Defending   "\
   ""\
   "INDFOR Assets x1 GUNTRUCK  x1 AP Sniper."\
   ""\
   "BLUFOR: British force Attacking"\
   ""\
   "BLUFOR Assets x2 fv721 foxs"\
   ""\
   "Time: 10:00:00"\
   ""\
   "Weather: rain"
   m_aFactionKeys {
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 1
  }
  COA_MissionDescriptor "{64425051F2E00216}" {
   m_sTitle "BLUFOR Objectives"
   m_sTextData "Got information from command, that some rebels have gotten their hands on some serious levels of Ordinances. swifty rectify this and restore control over the town. "\
   "locate and dispose of the cached explosives before it's too late, recognisance shows that there been a lot of movement near the town's playground. suspected location of one of the bombs the other whereabouts is still unknown. "\
   ""
   m_aFactionKeys +{
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
  COA_MissionDescriptor "{64425051B9B5AF67}" {
   m_sTitle "OPFOR Objectives"
   m_sTextData "If OPFOR is playable, add mission objectives in bullet point list. Add details for each if you feel necessary, but keep it concise."
   m_aFactionKeys +{
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
  COA_MissionDescriptor "{644250519BE30999}" {
   m_sTitle "INDFOR Objectives"
   m_sTextData "After offloading the 2 main shipments of ordinances. we've got to get them stashed away, Quickly out of sight from prying eyes. But apparently a Scout has spotted Heavy Military troop movement Approaching from the north, "\
   "Better drop The hauling and pick up fighting positions. Even use some of the ordinances. To booby trap the surrounding buildings to slow down the advancement of the troops. They cannot secure. The Ordnance Caches At all cost. "
   m_aFactionKeys +{
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
  COA_MissionDescriptor "{6442505149CF6C93}" {
   m_sTitle "Administration"
   m_sTextData ""
   m_aFactionKeys +{
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
 }
